OL,3,AAsos confirms hackers sent
OL,4,A'unauthorised' notification to app
OL,5,Ausers
OL,6,
OL,7,FAsos says it is investigating
OL,8,F"unauthorised activity" involving
OL,9,Fthird-party platforms it uses after
OL,10,Fcustomers received a notification from
OL,11,Fits app sent by hackers.
OL,13,FDozens of people told the BBC they
OL,14,Freceived the strange "ASOS HACKED"
OL,15,Fmessage from the clothing and beauty
OL,16,Fstore's app on Tuesday morning - with
OL,17,Fsome saying it left them "scared" to
OL,18,Fopen the app.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,109,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11908
SC,0008
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1791366493
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AAsos confirms hackers sent
OL,4,A'unauthorised' notification to app
OL,5,Ausers
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe notification was addressed to the
OL,8,Fcompany's data protection officer and
OL,9,FIT teams in what cyber security experts
OL,10,Fsaid looked like a "brazen" extortion
OL,11,Fattempt.
OL,13,FAsos acknowledged the "unauthorised
OL,14,Fcustomer notification" on Tuesday
OL,15,Fafternoon, saying some "basic personal
OL,16,Finformation" may have been accessed.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
